/-!
# A060399

In base ten, we try to get the digits 1,2,3,...,9,0,1,2,3,... in order only using a sequence of increasing primes and each time choosing the smallest prime that will give the desired digit.

The 53 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

